@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT

### Smart search: exact match is returned by default
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search=Kayaak04&searchMode=smart&includeSimilar=false&page=1&limit=10
x-auth-token: {{adminToken}}

### Smart search: exact match stays first and similar matches are included
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search=Kayaak04&searchMode=smart&includeSimilar=true&page=1&limit=10
x-auth-token: {{adminToken}}

### Backwards-compatible partial search for existing consumers
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search=Kayaak04&page=1&limit=10
x-auth-token: {{adminToken}}
